3. CLEAN-ROOM STATEMENT
-----------------------

This firmware was written from scratch. It contains no source code from
esp-sdr, C5VRX or double-ESP-resso, which are GPL projects, and was not based
on their code. It is built on Espressif's Apache-2.0 headers and libraries,
ESP-IDF documentation, public facts, a facts-only specification, and
measurements made on real hardware. See docs/LICENSING.md and
docs/PROVENANCE.md.

4. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
-------------------------

Firmware built from this project also contains other people's software under
their own licences, mainly ESP-IDF and Espressif's PHY and RF libraries
(Apache-2.0) and FreeRTOS (MIT). Those licences still apply to those parts, and giving
someone a firmware binary carries obligations under them. See "Third-party
components" in docs/LICENSING.md.

